cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use PaletteBench, please cite this software."
title: "PaletteBench"
type: software
abstract: >-
  PaletteBench is a reproducible workbench for auditing categorical scientific
  colour palettes under normal vision, simulated colour-vision deficiencies,
  and grayscale. It produces publication-ready figures, tables, tidy data, and
  baseline-relative comparisons using transparent perceptual measurements.
authors:
